  "Grounded in Linguistic Relativity, Space Chronicles explores how language might evolve through interstellar migration. The Moon, Mars and Neptune frame three speculative worlds.": "太空信笺以语言相对论为基础，探索语言如何随星际迁徙演变。月球、火星与海王星构成三个思辨世界。",
  "Through a space keyboard, visitors release redesigned characters into descending text streams, turning each keystroke into a cultural signal to an unknown world.": "观众通过太空键盘，将重新设计的字符释放到下落的文字流中，让每次按键成为通向未知世界的文化信号。",
