  "01–02 KEEPING A CONNECTION Qiaopi combined letters and remittances. An address, handwriting and material support maintained ties with family. Archive: MOWCAP / UNESCO.": "01–02 保持联结 侨批结合了书信与汇款。地址、笔迹与物质支持维系着家人之间的联系。档案：MOWCAP / UNESCO。",
  "03–04 CHOOSING WHAT TO SHARE Earthrise offers a view of home. The Voyager Golden Record (1977) selects sounds and images for an unknown reader. Its cover provides decoding instructions. NASA / JPL.": "03–04 选择分享的内容 《地出》提供了回望家园的视角。旅行者金唱片（1977）为未知读者选择声音与图像，封面提供解码说明。NASA / JPL。",
  "05 LIVING WITH DELAY NASA HERA, 2022: a 45-day ground simulation with up to five minutes of one-way delay. This is a communication analogue, not an actual interplanetary mission.": "05 与延迟共处 NASA HERA，2022：为期 45 天的地面模拟，单程延迟最长五分钟。这是通信模拟，并非真实的星际任务。",
  "06 HEARING THE JOURNEY Katie Paterson, Earth–Moon–Earth (2007). Gaps in the lunar return signal become silences in a piano performance. Image: artist documentation.": "06 听见旅程 Katie Paterson，《地球—月球—地球》（2007）。月球返回信号中的缺失，转化为钢琴演奏中的静默。图片：艺术家档案。",
  "SOURCE IMAGES / MOWCAP · NASA / JPL · KATIE PATERSON": "图片来源 / MOWCAP · NASA / JPL · KATIE PATERSON",
  "A LETTER AS A RELATIONSHIP Memory gives a message its purpose; selection gives it form; distance changes its rhythm. Communication includes both the content and the conditions of receiving it.": "以信件维系关系 记忆赋予信息目的，选择赋予它形态，距离改变它的节奏。沟通既包含内容，也包含接收的条件。",
  "PROJECT INFERENCE A future traveller’s reply carries a local world back to Earth. This is a speculative narrative, not a documented reply to the Voyager Golden Record.": "项目推导 未来旅人的回信将异地世界带回地球。这是推想叙事，并非有记录的旅行者金唱片回信。",
