  "Our work is set in a future where humanity has entered the early stages of an interstellar civilization. By constructing a virtual scenario of multi-planetary cultures and linguistic ecologies, it explores how language evolves through space migration, shaping new forms of identity and cultural boundaries.": "作品设定于人类进入星际文明早期的未来。通过构建多行星文化与语言生态的虚拟情境，探索语言如何在太空迁徙中演变，形成新的身份认同与文化边界。",
  "LUNA, MARS, and NEPTUNE represent different stages of humanity’s exploration of space: the Moon marks the starting point, Mars represents one of the planets most comparable to Earth and a realistic target for future exploration, while Neptune symbolizes the distant frontier of human exploration into the outer Solar System.": "月球、火星与海王星代表人类探索太空的不同阶段：月球是起点；火星是与地球较为相似的行星之一，也是未来探索的现实目标；海王星则象征着人类迈向外太阳系的遥远边疆。",
